WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.760
Spoken by I.N.S. War Correspondent.

2
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.320
Look, there's Red.

3
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.820
Stop driver, pull in here.

4
00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:43.540
Hi, fellas.

5
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.420
Hop in, we're going your way.

6
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.780
Hop in, Red, there's plenty of room.

7
00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:48.600
Thanks for the lift.

8
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:50.920
Merrill Mueller.

9
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.800
That news van's certainly in a hurry.

10
00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:03.400
Look at that other one get away.

11
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.600
You've got to admire the way they get

12
00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.840
the newspapers out every day.

13
00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.560
Day after day to keep the public informed.

14
00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.280
And night after night too.

15
00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:21.860
Risking much for your morning newspaper.

16
00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:30.440
During London's worst raids, they never fail to

17
00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:30.820
get out.

18
00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:38.820
One night...

19
00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:47.870
Incident, Blackfriars.

20
00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.850
Hello, Control, Blackfriars Box speaking.

21
00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.650
Can't get the Ramsgate paper train out from

22
00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:55.930
Holborn.

23
00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:58.170
Right, we'll divert it to Cannon Street.

24
00:01:58.310 --> 00:01:59.010
Send loading staff.

25
00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:03.650
Send reserve paper train to Cannon Street immediately.

26
00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.430
Incident, Cannon Street.

27
00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.250
Hello, Control, Cannon Street Inspector here.

28
00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:17.350
Can't do Ramsgate paper train.

29
00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:18.290
Line's blocked.

30
00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:19.630
We'll divert it to London Bridge.

31
00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:20.530
Send loading staff.

32
00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:21.470
Advise newspapers.

33
00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:29.010
Incident, London Bridge.

34
00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:31.350
London Bridge Assistant Station Master speaking.

35
00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.310
Lines and communications blocked.

36
00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.530
Can't get Ramsgate paper train from here.

37
00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:37.430
Right, we'll divert to Victoria.

38
00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:38.470
Send runner.

39
00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:40.970
Send reserve paper train to Victoria immediately.

40
00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:46.070
Ramsgate paper train will be dealt with at

41
00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:46.470
Victoria.

42
00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:47.430
We'll be late.

43
00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:48.710
Advise newspapers.

44
00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:04.290
The Ramsgate newspaper train got out four hours

45
00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:04.590
late.

46
00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:08.710
But it got out.

47
00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.320
Through damage such as this.

48
00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.720
But even then, it wasn't out of danger.

49
00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.850
Honest news keeps us all awake to the

50
00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:47.630
world's developments.

51
00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:55.370
While false dispatches make Nazi propaganda ludicrous.

52
00:04:56.490 --> 00:05:01.390
Accurate, objective newspapers will help us all to

53
00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:03.790
play our part in sharing the benefits of

54
00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:08.330
the better world, we can and must create.

55
00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:20.300
Hello, Red.

56
00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:20.760
How are you?

57
00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:21.520
Hi, Chris.

58
00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.680
Remember that news train story of yours?

59
00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:26.920
Sure.

60
00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.220
Have a cigarette?

61
00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.000
Just been telling it to a couple of

62
00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:32.560
friends of mine.

63
00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:34.260
Got a match?

64
00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:36.100
Yes, sure.

65
00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:43.820
What's this?

66
00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.200
Well, I'll be damned.
